HARK! "A Most Agreeable Salutation"
  or, "In Which the World is Greeted with Appropriate Ceremony"

(ASIDE, AT SOME LENGTH:
  The traditional opening gambit of any self-respecting program.
  We have spared no expense in its composition.
END OF ASIDE.)

PRINCIPALS
  PRAY WELCOME greeting  AS A YARN  BEING "Hello, World!"
  PRAY WELCOME recipient AS A YARN  BEING "World"
THE CURTAIN RISES.

BEHOLD "A Most Agreeable Salutation"
BEHOLD "================================"

BEHOLD greeting

BEHOLD WOVEN OF "I am delighted to make your acquaintance, " AND recipient AND "." IF YOU PLEASE.

BEHOLD "Yours, with the utmost sincerity and corroborative detail,"
BEHOLD "  A Topsy Program"

FINALE.
